[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼……呼……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15773"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鹰原哥！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"耳边的怒吼声把我给吓醒了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15824"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"转头一看，是羽未站在了那里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是羽未啊。早上好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15826"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“什么早上好啊！你在干什么呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“干什么……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i444"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"环顾四周。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里是外面。在海边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于弄明白了状况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"昨晚我就直接在这里睡着了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呜呜，好冷……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身体凉透了。好冷。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15826"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“就算是夏天，在海边睡一晚上也会感冒的！一把岁数的人了在想什么啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被她狠狠骂了一顿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，她的怒吼莫名让人感到温暖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为这说明她真的很关心我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“先不说那些。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“给你这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从口袋里掏出了一个小饰品。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这是……什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了看手掌，上面躺着一个干瘪的海星。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，拿错了。这是我捡来打算留作纪念的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是这个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到我拿出来的另一样东西，羽未睁大了眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是一个用贝壳做成的四叶草造型发卡。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我猜应该就是这个，对不对？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“对！就是这个！应该就是这个！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15791"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你该不会是……自己一个人找了一整晚吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也不是整晚啦，中间都睡着了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且如果找不到的话，我本来打算就放弃的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15774"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“但这不是一直没放弃，最后还找到了吗！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不知不觉就找得起劲了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鹰原哥……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，你就帮我把这个还回去吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把发卡交给羽未。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15812"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就拜托你了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我要回去在被窝里睡个好觉了。哈～欠。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15768"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“非常感谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到羽未的道谢，我背对着她挥了挥手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微装模作样了一下。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊――真是累死了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“身上感觉沙沙的。得洗个澡……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然这么想，但身体已经不听使唤了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……算了，就这样吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有些粗暴地铺好被褥。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，我就这样沉沉地睡去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯――……嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈――欠……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再次睡醒的时候已经是下午了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊，你醒了啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇!؟羽未……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚睡醒就看到羽未在，吓了一跳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你一直在这里吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“没有，我刚进来，想看看你是不是还在睡。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，吓了我一跳……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“浴缸里的水已经烧好了哦。既然醒了就去洗个澡吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是为我准备的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“在海边待了一整晚，身上肯定黏糊糊的，而且还全是沙子吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“全是沙子……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊，你看被子上沾上沙了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“被子我来晾干，你快去洗澡吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好、好的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未强行扯走了我的被子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“要好好泡个澡哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不然是消除不了疲劳的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“知道了。那我去洗澡了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不管怎么说，她特意为我烧了热水还是让我很开心的。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i708"},{"op":"image","layer":2307,"image":"i708"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i342"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼，好舒服的热水。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"睡了一觉又泡了个热水澡，身心都完全复苏了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未她好温柔啊，我的努力真是没有白费呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚咚咚咚咚……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？好像有脚步声……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哗啦！"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15457"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鹰原哥！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未突然闯进了浴室！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呀啊啊啊啊啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15596"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呀!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15562"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“请、请不要发出怪叫！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“浴室门突然打开的话，当然会吓一跳啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15541"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你是小姑娘吗！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可是处于青春期啊！男生也是会害羞的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说回来，你开门是想做什么……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15444"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15441"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“想帮你搓搓背。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说她是个小女孩，但让女孩子搓背还是有点难为情吧？"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15435"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“如果不方便的话……就算了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未看起来有点失落。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到她这副表情，就这样拒绝的话感觉有点不近人情……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……那，既然你都这么说了……就麻烦你了，可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以拜托你吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15441"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哎？好、好的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未一脸紧张地点了点头。明明她是自己主动来的，难道到眼前了反而害羞起来了？"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15443"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那么，我进来了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，她小心翼翼地走进了浴室。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15358"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个，嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“请从浴缸里出来坐到这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，要出来吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15373"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“要不然没法帮你搓背啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对哦。泡在水里确实没法搓背呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个，那个……你不要看这边哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15332"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我不会看的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未气呼呼地喊道，闭上眼睛又转过身去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从浴缸里出来，坐在了浴室的凳子上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算没被看到，和她在同一个空间里赤身裸体还是很害羞啊……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15477"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未尽量不看这边，站在了我的身后。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15459"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那么，我、我开始搓了哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她拿起涂了肥皂的毛巾，开始擦洗我的后背。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“会痛吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不会，一点都不痛。再用点力也没关系。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15459"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那这样可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以再再用力一点哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未的手上多使了点劲。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15503"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嘿咻……嘿咻……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对对，就是这样。还可以再用力点哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯――！呼――！嘿――咻！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦……好、好舒服……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，你擦背擦得真好啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15459"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是吗？嘿咻，嘿咻。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未很认真地帮我擦着后背。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15456"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嘿咻，嘿咻。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是不说话的话，感觉会有点尴尬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，你经常帮爸爸擦背吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得这应该是个无关痛痒的话题，但是……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15480"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未的声音明显低沉了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来也不是这么回事啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……这种事，我还是第一次做。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一说，我想起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我之前还觉得羽未和她爸爸的关系似乎不太好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是说错话了吗。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15486"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"气氛又变得有些尴尬了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15483"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“所以，其实我不太清楚该用多大力。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未带着歉意说道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，这样真的刚刚好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15456"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那就好。”"},{"op":"goto","target":346},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那么，接下来帮你洗头发吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？可以吗？”"},{"op":"goto","target":353},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没想到她连头发都要帮我洗。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那我先给你冲下热水。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦呜……吓我一跳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15351"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊，对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事没事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那我开始洗了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感到洗发水浇在了湿漉漉的头发上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后她的小手开始来回揉动我的头发。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“有没有觉得痒的地方？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，发际线那边。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是这里吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对对……啊――……好舒服……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"力道没有很重，或者非要说的话，是一种有点弱小靠不太住的感觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但这种感觉却让我很惬意，再加上闭着眼睛，不知不觉就有点想睡着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15379"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哇！请不要乱动！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对、对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实我并没有动，只是因为困了身体失去了力气而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然觉得睡着也太不好……但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嗯……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的脖子猛地一歪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被自己这样的动作吓了一跳，下意识想要站起来的瞬间……"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呀!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个没刹住撞到了身后的羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我以一种靠在羽未身上的姿势，失去了平衡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15342"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜喵――――――！”"},{"op":"goto","target":357},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11565"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“怎、怎么了!؟”"},{"op":"goto","target":371},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15364"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜喵……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11598"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀哎呀……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨面带微笑。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11637"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀哎呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一直都在微笑……"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"clear","layer":2307},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你明白错哪了吗？羽依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11574"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这可不行哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的……对不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从浴室出来后，不知为何只有我一个人被说教了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别、别哭啊。好像只有我做错事似的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里，你听好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你们两个人的年龄差，等再长大一点的时候，也就显得很微不足道了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“亲戚只要隔了四亲等以上，在法律上也是可以结婚的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？那个，呃……镜子阿姨？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11574"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“但是，现在还不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你们两个都还是孩子呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11575"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“交往必须要有分寸才行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是，等等。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，我得给姐姐打个电话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等――――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨的说教完全跑偏到了西边。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都说了别哭了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我明明觉得自己努力做了件好事来着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是世事难料啊……"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"clear","layer":2307},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，不过……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再往下的地方就不用擦了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15494"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我、我知道的！我只打算擦后背！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是当然。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"万一她说要洗别处的话，我反而不知道该怎么办了。"},{"op":"goto","target":237},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15329"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我从后面帮你洗哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是当然。”"},{"op":"goto","target":241},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样把羽未给扑倒了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对、对不起！羽未你没事吧!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我手忙脚乱地赶紧站了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在羽未的面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"甚至没想起来自己现在是什么样子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15354"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15335"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未·羽依里","text":"“呜喵――――――――！”“呀――――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人的尖叫声在浴室里回荡。"},{"op":"goto","target":278},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，镜子阿姨，现在不能开……”"},{"op":"goto","target":281},{"op":"end"}]